# Integrity pin for the trusted-firmware source scripts/build-agsim.sh compiles and
# runs. The root module is not in go.mod, so go.sum does not cover it, and
# first-party modules bypass the checksum database; this file is its go.sum.
# Format: <module> <version> <h1 hash of the module zip>. Bumping the
# trusted-firmware/sdk/go dependency means adding the new version's line here:
#   go mod download -json github.com/jeremyhahn/trusted-firmware@<version>   (the "Sum" field)
github.com/jeremyhahn/trusted-firmware v0.4.2-alpha h1:grU5O32H5kJGxK4qZy7D8akly0zaFs8S5xQyQYhH+2w=
